<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="believe-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="believe-title">Security should be in proportion.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="split-body">
      <p>Enough to keep people safe, and never more than the job needs. A door team that starts fights is worse than no door team, and a guard who ignores visitors is no guard at all.</p>
      <p>Our officers represent your business while they are on your site. So we choose people who stay calm under pressure, talk before they act, and write down what happened.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

