      <p class="sec-lede">Our line is the promise we make on every booking.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="line-list">
      <li><h3>On site</h3><p>Licensed officers where you need them, briefed on your site and your instructions.</p></li>
      <li><h3>On time</h3><p>When we say the team will be there, the team is there. If anything changes, you hear from us first.</p></li>
      <li><h3>On record</h3><p>Names and licence numbers before the shift, a written report after it.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

